{
  "id": "ISA.24",
  "number": "24",
  "bookId": "ISA",
  "reference": "Isaya 24",
  "verseCount": 23,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "24",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 24"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "24",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AABBO Waaqi lafa ch'ufa balleese ona tolcha. Inni lafa mich'iire, nama keesa tau ch'ufa gargari firfirsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wonti kunini nama ch'ufa woliqit'eesite akuma taka qabatti — qaaloleefi gumi, tisseleefi abbooti, ka wo bituufi ka wo gurguru, ka wo ergisufi ka ergifatu, dureesafi hiyyeesale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti badde ona taati. Dubbi tana AABBO Waaqati jed'e inhanqattu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti qanch'ooratte gogoddi; lafti ch'ufti lalaafte, lafafi gubbaleeni shamti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Biyyiti yayu seera Waaqa balleesite kakhu inni haga jiru kakhate ch'absite, akanaani lafa t'ureesite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tanaafi Waaqi yayu lafa abaare, biyyitileeni maro wollaala ufitifi gaargaluu jirti. Duuba biyyiti d'umatte, nami diqayaani hafe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukhi zabibu qanch'oorate, daad'ileeni lafa keesati diqaate, nami duri gammada qabu ch'ufti amma nahe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "duuba sirba worri kiraariifi dibbeeni gammadaani sirbu hobaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami deebie gammadaani sirbe daad'i ind'ugu. Farsoni deebite namati imioftu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira keesa wonti ch'ufti aka iraa gorte, namileeni sodaa jed'e mana ch'ufate keesaa yau dad'abe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dira keesa farso d'abani nami iyyaa yaa; gammadi ya lafa keesaa bade, deebie indeebiu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diri ya bade ona tahe, balbala fullo isale ya ch'ach'absani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gosa lafa keesa jirtu ch'ufa waan kanati qabata, wonti sunini muraansa mid'aani fakaati, gaafa mid'aani ejersa mukha iraa d'aanani mid'aani zabibu mukha isii ira guurani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami hafe gammadaani sirbe worri ila aduuleeni guddinna AABBO Waaqa odeese. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Worri ilaboruleeni isa faarsa. Ammalle nami d'aatu baariini tau AABBO Waaqa Israeli faarsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haga muumme lafa nu faaru gosa Israeli ta d'uga faarsani d'ageenna.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ammo anini ya bade hobau jira! Nami nama yaku huji ufi ta namaani yaku illakisu yo iti hammate male. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me, nami ch'ufti na ch'aqasa, mudamsufi boolafi t'ururati isani eegata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nami mudamsu baqatu ch'ufti boola keesa bua, ammalle nami boola baqattu t'urura keesa bua. Bokayi gubba farqate, yayabi lafaleeni chochoa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti dayaate, baqate, gargari tarsaati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lafti aka nama farso d'uge machae daat'e, aka hoosa bubbeeni chochoofte taati. Dabi lafa ira dabre lafa balleese, deebie kau d'owa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guyyaani ind'ufa, ka AABBO Waaqi waan gubba mohatatifi waan lafa mohatale gaargalchu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waaqi worra lafa mohatu suni boola keesati wolti guure hid'a. Inni booluma keesati worra lakisa, haga guyyaani worra gaargalchani gahuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jii dukanae aduuleni ifsu diddi; wonti akanatiifi AABBO Waaqa guddati Yerusalemu keesa gaara Sioni irati nama fide, jaaroleleeni guddinna isaa agarti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.24.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Faaru Waaqaani faarsani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
